url: "https://hichamdz85.github.io/executive-market-research/"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Claude skill that produces investor-grade market research
  reports - in PDF and interactive HTML - for any product, sector, or country,
  in English, Arabic (RTL), or French. Built on a triangulated 7-rule
  research methodology with live web sources (UN Comtrade, World Bank, IMF,
  EIU). Distributed as a Claude Code plugin with bundled MCP server.
